<title>INDIA: India Cipla 1996/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India Cipla 1996/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    705.6	vs     289.6</p>
<p>    Net sales	   4,520.6	vs   3,611.2</p>
<p>    Other income	  256.2	vs	79.1</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 3,578.2	vs   3,095.1</p>
<p>    Interest		106.0	vs     149.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   77.0	vs	71.1</p>
<p>    Tax		     310.0	vs	85.0</p>
<p>Note: Cipla Ltd is among India's leading pharmaceutical firms. The latest results are unaudited, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
